# Docker build context is the workspace root (which holds dash/ and backdash/).
# Opt in to just those two repos so unrelated repos, worktrees and caches are
# never uploaded to the daemon.
*
!dash
!dash/**
!backdash
!backdash/**

# ...but none of their build artifacts or VCS data (all rebuilt from source).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-journal
**/coverage
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
